workspaces.help = Tereka Nga ekola kopi erina erinnya ey'enteekateeka eriwo. Londa enteekateeka eyaterekwa okugikozesa, okugizza obuggya, okugikyusa erinnya oba okugiggyawo. Enkyukakyuka mu nteekateeka zikola amangu ddala.
