workspaces.limit = Osobola okutereka ebifo eby'okukoleramu ebitasukka 64.
workspaces.keyboard = Kiboodi: Alt+↑/↓ eronda enteekateeka. Ctrl/Cmd+N ekyusa erinnya lyayo; +S etereka kopi; +Enter egikozesa; +U egizza obuggya; +R egikyusa erinnya; +D egiggyawo; +0 eddamu okugiteekawo.
